OUR VISION:

PMGI aspires to become a leading provider of property maintenance and development services, particularly for  large-scale horizontal and vertical projects.

OUR MISSION:

PMGI will achieve its Vision by:
Providing consistent and high-quality property maintenance and allied services to all of its clients through  qualified and well-trained personnel and use of appropriate tools, equipment and technologies.
Giving value for money to clients by enhancing or preserving the value of maintained properties;
Utilizing the most effective and environment friendly technologies in servicing our clients;
Creating a work environment for its associates that will encourage and motivate them to demonstrate
exemplary performance and behavior at work;
Continuously upgrading the skills proficiencies of personnel;
Exhibiting high standards of integrity and professionalism.
